OL,3,GNEWSAStormont 'shouldn't throw in
OL,4,Atowel' over extra funds from
OL,5,AWestminster - O'Neill
OL,6,
OL,7,FMinisters should not "throw in the
OL,8,Ftowel" when it comes to trying to
OL,9,Fsecure extra funding from the UK
OL,10,Fgovernment to stabilise Stormont's
OL,11,Ffinances, First Minister Michelle
OL,12,FO'Neill has said.
OL,14,FO'Neill was speaking ahead of an urgent
OL,15,Fmeeting of ministers on Tuesday.
OL,17,FNo budget has been agreed by the
OL,18,Fpower-sharing coalition six months into
OL,19,Fthe financial year, with Stormont
OL,20,Fparties pressing Westminster for more
OL,21,Ffunding.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
